{"schema_version":1,"key":"dish-946a3f88bdec","reference_recipes":[{"id":"howtocook-946a3f88bdec","name":"水油焖蔬菜","category":"vegetable_dish","url":"https://github.com/Anduin2017/HowToCook/blob/0e106eea348c734fe1586f781202994439cf98a5/dishes/vegetable_dish/%E6%B0%B4%E6%B2%B9%E7%84%96%E8%94%AC%E8%8F%9C.md","blob_sha":"843a13bf18da320a3a70727a9c81db8802f848b3","details":{"introduction":"水油焖蔬菜是一道简单快手的家常佐餐，通过沸水加几滴油和调料，让叶菜口感软嫩、色泽油亮，既清爽又带有淡淡油香。这种做法有助于提高脂溶性维生素的吸收率，比生吃蔬菜更有营养价值。烹饪难度低，对新手非常友好，从洗菜到出锅一般只需 10 分钟。","difficulty":"★★","sections":[{"heading":"必备原料和工具","markdown":"* 食用油\n* 盐\n* 蚝油（可选）\n* 叶菜类蔬菜"},{"heading":"计算","markdown":"叶菜类蔬菜含水量较多，在准备时可能看起来体积很大。实际受热后体积会迅速减小。\n\n* 叶菜类蔬菜：300g ~ 500g"},{"heading":"操作","markdown":"1. 洗净蔬菜\n2. 锅中加入 150ml 水，并烧开。（水不需要能完全没过蔬菜）\n3. 加入 3g 盐\n4. （可选）加入 3ml 蚝油\n5. 加入 2ml 食用油\n6. 下菜， 翻拌一下，然后盖上锅盖焖 1 分钟\n7. 盛盘"},{"heading":"附加内容","markdown":"* 不确定咸淡的情况， 可以先少放盐， 在出锅前尝味， 考虑调整加盐\n* 可以用鸡汤、骨头汤等替代水， 更好吃\n* 焖的时间不可过长"}]}}],"nutrition":{"status":"reference","basis":"per_100g","serving_g":null,"scope":"2–3人家庭标准配方估算：小白菜400g、大豆食用油12g、食盐3g、饮用水60g；整份约350g。叶菜明确选择小白菜，清水版，不加蚝油或高汤。净量及成品重为明确标准假设，非实测；未做烹饪损失校正，所有列入的油糖酱均计入。","per_100g":{"energy_kcal":45.165714,"protein_g":1.714286,"carbohydrate_g":2.491429,"fat_g":3.657143},"source":{"name":"USDA FoodData Central","url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/170390/nutrients","version":"0f9fa2018fb7c37b","fdc_ids":[170390,171411,173468,173647]},"profile_id":"family-946a3f88bdec-v1","recipe_id":"howtocook-946a3f88bdec","review_status":"approved","method":"usda_recipe_estimate","recipe_basis":"standardized_assumptions","is_estimate":true,"match":{"food_identity":"howtocook-946a3f88bdec","state":"ready_to_eat","cooking_method":"braise","edible_part":"explicit_net_edible_ingredients_without_bones_shells_or_discarded_parts","oil_added":true,"sugar_added":false,"sauce_added":false,"brand":null,"variant":"family-946a3f88bdec-v1","standard_ingredients":[{"key":"bok_choy","grams":400},{"key":"oil","grams":12},{"key":"salt","gr